        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rico Blanco\n- Organizations: Rivermaya, Kodaline\n- Products: Galactik Fiestamatik\n- Roles: songwriter, vocalist, guitarist, keyboardist, solo artist\n\nFacts:\n- Rivermaya is a Filipino rock band.\n- Kodaline is an Irish band.\n- From 1994 until 2007, Rico Blanco was a founding member of Rivermaya and served as its chief songwriter, vocalist, guitarist, and keyboardist.\n- Since 2008, Rico Blanco has been a solo artist.\n- Galactik Fiestamatik is the second studio album of Rico Blanco.",
